# Retries: a failed request (connection error, timeout, failed test) is sent
# again. An HTTP error status alone is not a failure, so add a test.

### Retry up to 3 times, 200ms apart
# @name retried
# @retry 3 200ms
# @timeout 5s
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/200

> {% test("not a server error", () => expect(res.status).toBeLessThan(500)) %}

### Poll until a job is done (here it is done at once)
# @name poll
# @retry 5 1s
GET {{baseUrl}}/anything/jobs/1?state=done

> {% test("done", () => expect(res.json().args.state).toBe("done")) %}
